# byte1=G, byte2=R, byte3=0). Clips against the canvas's own current
# g_canvas_w/g_canvas_h -- a source pixel whose DESTINATION position
# would land outside the canvas is silently skipped, not written,
# rather than corrupting an adjacent row (an unclipped write at
