# win_peek_message() -> the raw Win32 message code if one was pending
# (0 if the queue was empty -- WM_NULL, never a real message a caller
# needs to act on, so doubles safely as the "nothing happened" idle
# sentinel). WM_PAINT is fully serviced HERE (BeginPaint/StretchDIBits/
