# never reaches DispatchMessageW at all. Every other message is
# Translate+Dispatch'd normally (reaching the trampoline ->
# DefWindowProcW for default handling, e.g. WM_CLOSE's default already
# calls DestroyWindow for us) -- the caller inspects the returned code
# (WM_CLOSE=16, WM_DESTROY=2) to decide whether to stop its own main
# loop; this primitive never decides that itself.
