# see patlang_wndproc_trampoline's own header for why a real resize
# never shows up in that queue at all. When set, does the actual DIB
# reallocation right here (main-thread, not from inside the
# trampoline -- CreateDIBSection etc are real, possibly slow WinAPI
# calls, not something to run from a window-procedure callback that
